---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE, hasPhone } from '@/config/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Website Terms of Use | Kinematics"
  h1="Terms of use"
  description="The terms that apply when you use kinematicstech.ca, the website of Kinematics Technologies Inc., including quotes, parcel tracking, content and liability."
  path="/terms"
  intro={`These terms apply to your use of ${SITE.domain} (the “site”), operated by ${SITE.legalName} (“${SITE.brand}”, “we”, “us”). By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.`}
>
  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>The site explains our fulfillment and delivery services and lets you contact us, request a quote, apply for roles and check the status of a parcel. You may use it for lawful purposes only. You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>try to gain unauthorized access to the site, our systems or other people’s information;</li>
    <li>interfere with how the site works, or overload it, including with automated tools;</li>
    <li>send false, misleading, harmful or unlawful information through our forms;</li>
    <li>use the tracking tool to look up parcels that are not yours or that you are not authorized to follow;</li>
    <li>copy or scrape the site’s content for commercial use without our permission.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may suspend or restrict access to the site, or any part of it, at any time.</p>

  <h2>Is a quote a binding offer?</h2>
  <p>No. Information on the site, and any response to the quote form, is not a binding offer and does not create a contract. A quote is an estimate based on the information you provide and may change if that information changes. Our services are provided only under a written agreement signed with each business customer, and that agreement takes priority over anything on the site.</p>

  <h2>Parcel tracking information</h2>
  <p>Tracking information is provided “as is” and “as available” for convenience. It comes from scans and systems that can be delayed or incomplete, and estimated delivery times are estimates, not guarantees. If a delivery matters to you for a particular reason, contact the merchant you ordered from or contact us.</p>

  <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
  <p>We work to keep the site accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee that it is complete, current or free of errors, or that it will be available without interruption. Service descriptions, delivery areas and delivery times on the site are general and are confirmed for each customer in their agreement. We may change the site at any time without notice.</p>

