  <p>The site and its content, including text, illustrations, 3D graphics, video, the {SITE.brand} name, logo and design, belong to {SITE.legalName} or are used with permission, and are protected by Canadian and international copyright and trademark laws. You may view the site and share links to it. You may print or save pages for your own personal or internal business reference. Any other use, including copying, modifying or republishing our content or using our name or logo, requires our written permission.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>The site may link to websites run by others, such as online store platforms or government resources. We provide these links for convenience only. We do not control those websites and are not responsible for their content, availability or privacy practices.</p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, the site is provided without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. {SITE.legalName}, its directors, employees and service providers are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential loss or damage, or for loss of profits, data or business, arising from your use of the site, your inability to use it or your reliance on its content, including tracking information. Liability for our services is governed by the written agreement with each customer, not by these terms. Nothing in these terms limits any liability that cannot be limited under applicable law.</p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal information, and our <a href="/cookies">cookie notice</a> explains how we use cookies and similar technologies.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Ontario and the federal laws of Canada that apply there. You agree that the courts of Ontario have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute about these terms or the site.</p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The effective date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to {SITE.legalName}, {SITE.address.locality}, {SITE.address.regionName}, at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>{hasPhone() && <> or {SITE.phone}</>}, or through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
